{"speciesId":599,"names":{"fr":"Tic","es":"Klink","en":"Klink","ja":"ギアル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La compatibilité entre ses deux rouages est prédéterminée. Ceux-ci ne se fixeront à aucun autre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le mouvement de ses deux corps enchâssés produit l’énergie qui lui est nécessaire pour vivre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Interlocking two bodies and spinning around generates the energy they need to live."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Two bodies comprise a fixed pair. They spin around each other to generate energy."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Two bodies comprise a fixed pair. They spin around each other to generate energy."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le mouvement de ses deux corps enchâssés produit l’énergie qui lui est nécessaire pour vivre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Genera la energía vital que necesita haciendo girar sus dos cuerpos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Interlocking two bodies and spinning around generates the energy they need to live."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２つの 体が かみ合い 回転することで 生きるための エネルギーを 作り出している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La compatibilité entre ses deux rouages est prédéterminée. Ceux-ci ne se fixeront à aucun autre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La combinación de sus dos cuerpos es predeterminada. Si no se corresponde con su homólogo, se separa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２つの 体は 組み合わせが 決まっている。別の 体とは かみ合わずに 離れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le mouvement de ses deux corps enchâssés produit l’énergie qui lui est nécessaire pour vivre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Genera la energía vital que necesita haciendo girar sus dos cuerpos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Interlocking two bodies and spinning around generates the energy they need to live."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２つの 体が かみ合い 回転することで 生きるための エネルギーを 作り出している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La compatibilité entre ses deux rouages est prédéterminée. Ceux-ci ne se fixeront à aucun autre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La combinación de sus dos cuerpos es predeterminada. Si no se corresponde con su homólogo, se separa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２つの 体は 組み合わせが 決まっている。別の 体とは かみ合わずに 離れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses deux rouages sont plus soudés que des jumeaux. Si on essaie de les combiner à d’autres rouages, ils ne s’entendent pas très bien."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Los dos cuerpos que lo componen están más unidos que unos gemelos. Si intentaran acoplarse a otros, no lograrían encajar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The two minigears that compose this Pokémon are closer than twins. They mesh well only with each other."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"２つの 体は 双子よりも 近い。 べつの 体同士だと いまいち うまく 噛み合わない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les humains auraient inventé les mécanismes à engrenages il y a fort longtemps, en observant ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que en tiempos remotos los seres humanos se inspiraron en este Pokémon para inventar el mecanismo de engranaje."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s suspected that Klink were the inspiration behind ancient people’s invention of the first gears."},{"la